Author: ubehera <umankshree@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu May 28 12:07:21 2026 -0600

    [Bugfix][ModelLoader] fastsafetensors: fix multinode device + add nogds opt-out
    
    Two related fixes in `fastsafetensors_weights_iterator`:
    
    1. Use `torch.cuda.current_device()` instead of the global TP rank as the
       CUDA device index. With one GPU per node (cross-node TP=2 over
       single-GPU hosts, e.g. NVIDIA DGX Spark / GB10), the global rank
       exceeds the local GPU count: rank-1 resolves to `cuda:1`, which does
       not exist on that node. Loading then fails with an obscure CUDA
       device-not-found error mid-weight-load. Using the local device is
       correct in both single-node and multi-node settings.
    
    2. Expose the fastsafetensors `nogds` knob via a new
       `SGLANG_FASTSAFETENSORS_NOGDS` env var. fastsafetensors defaults to
       GPU Direct Storage (cuFile), which requires kernel + filesystem
       support. NFS, SMB, FUSE, and similar shared filesystems don't
       support cuFile, so `loader.copy_files_to_device()` fails at the GDS
       path. The non-GDS fallback streams through CPU memory and works on
       any POSIX-readable backing. Default behavior is unchanged.
    
    Validated locally on cross-node TP=2 over NAS-mounted models on
    GB10 / DGX Spark (1 GPU/node), where both bugs prevented model load.
    
    This consolidates two long-carried local patches.
    
    Co-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/python/sglang/srt/environ.py b/python/sglang/srt/environ.py
index 331d8eb3a..68e6a0981 100644
--- a/python/sglang/srt/environ.py
+++ b/python/sglang/srt/environ.py
@@ -207,6 +207,10 @@ class Envs:
     SGLANG_DISABLED_MODEL_ARCHS = EnvTuple(tuple())
     SGLANG_PREFETCH_BLOCK_SIZE_MB = EnvInt(16)
     SGLANG_GEMMA_OUT_OF_PLACE_POSITION_MUTATION = EnvBool(False)
+    # Force fastsafetensors to skip GPU Direct Storage (cuFile) and use
+    # the CPU-staged fallback. Required when models live on storage
+    # backends without cuFile support (NFS, SMB, FUSE).
+    SGLANG_FASTSAFETENSORS_NOGDS = EnvBool(False)
 
     # Logging Options
     SGLANG_LOG_GC = EnvBool(False)
